":"18 53 113","corresponding":null,"first":"Gongbo","key":"zhaogongbopau","last":"Zhao","name":"Zhao, Gongbo","rank":310,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"34 53","corresponding":null,"first":"Zheng","key":"zhengzhengpau","last":"Zheng","name":"Zheng, Zheng","rank":311,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"100","corresponding":null,"first":"Guangtun","key":"zhuguangtunpau","last":"Zhu","name":"Zhu, Guangtun","rank":313,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"53","corresponding":null,"first":"Hu","key":"zouhupau","last":"Zou","name":"Zou, Hu","rank":314,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3847/1538-4365/ab929e","issn":["15384365"],"issue":"1","journal":"Astrophysical Journal Supplement Series","paperid":"3","publisher":"Institute of Physics Publishing","status":"p","title":"Astrophysical Journal Supplement Series","volume":"249"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85088298365"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-778973ca-a401-4f7a-aa8b-a46547463bf3"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"The 16th Data Release of the Sloan Digital Sky Surveys : First Release from the APOGEE-2 Southern Survey and Full Release of eBOSS Spectra","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-197705","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Leptin influences food intake by informing the brain about the status of body fat stores. Rare LEP mutations associated with congenital leptin deficiency cause severe early-onset obesity that can be mitigated by administering leptin. However, the role of genetic regulation of leptin in polygenic obesity remains poorly understood. We performed an exome-based analysis in up to 57,232 individuals of diverse ancestries to identify genetic variants that influence adiposity-adjusted leptin concentrations. We identify five novel variants, including four missense variants, in LEP, ZNF800, KLHL31, and ACTL9, and one intergenic variant near KLF14 The missense variant Val94Met (rs17151919) in LEP was common in individuals of African ancestry only and its association with lower leptin concentrations was specific to this ancestry (P=2x10-16, n=3,901). Using in vitro analyses, we show that the Met94 allele decreases leptin secretion. We also show that the Met94 allele is associated with higher BMI in young African-ancestry children but not in adults, suggesting leptin regulates early adiposity.","author_count":51,"contributors":["Yaghootkar, Hanieh","Zhang, Yiying","Spracklen, Cassandra N","Karaderi, Tugce","Huang, Lam Opal","Bradfield, Jonathan","Schurmann, Claudia","Fine, Rebecca S","Preuss, Michael H","Kutalik, Zoltan","Wittemans, Laura Bl","Lu, Yingchang","Metz, Sophia","Willems, Sara M","Li-Gao, Ruifang","Grarup, Niels","Wang, Shuai","Molnos, Sophie","Sandoval-Zárate, América A","Nalls, Mike A","Lange, Leslie A","Haesser, Jeffrey","Guo, Xiuqing","Lyytikäinen, Leo-Pekka","Feitosa, Mary F","Sitlani, Colleen M","Venturini, Cristina","Mahajan, Anubha","Kacprowski, Tim","Wang, Carol A","Chasman, Daniel I","Amin, Najaf","Broer, Linda","Robertson, Neil","Young, Kristin L","Allison, Matthew","Auer, Paul L","Blüher, Matthias","Borja, Judith B","Bork-Jensen, Jette","Carrasquilla, Germán D","Christofidou, Paraskevi","Demirkan, Ayse","Doege, Claudia A","Jakupovic, Hermina","Li, Jin","Lind, Lars","Kovacs, Peter","Hansen, Torben","Loos, Ruth JF","Kilpeläinen, Tuomas O"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-419467"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corpau":["Leptin Exomechip Collaboration"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genetic studies of leptin concentrations implicate leptin in the regulation of early adiposity","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"https://europepmc.org/copyright","type":"rem","url":"https://europepmc.org/articles/pmc7679778?pdf=render","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-419467","identifier":[{"id":"32917775","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85096618864","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000594819600025","type":"wos"},{"id":"PMC7679778","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-2baf251b-d39f-4ce1-a9cf-8c46263c295e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BD22E3678FED5AC0129C171A6C46517F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"https://europepmc.org/copyright","type":"rem","url":"https://europepmc.org/articles/pmc7679778?pdf=render","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Protein Research, Brunak Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":2,"key":"leptin exomechip collaboration","name":"Leptin Exomechip Collaboration","role":"oau"}],"person"