ies","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-3572f5f7-95d8-497e-b87f-f98b626e2218","ku-cda94f9e-148a-495c-94e5-04b7988b10a4"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Large meta-analysis of genome-wide association studies identifies five loci for lean body mass","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.92-016533","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Ionospheric irregularities cause rapid fluctuations of radio wave amplitude and phase that candegrade GPS positional accuracy and affect performance of radio communication and navigation systems. The ionosphere becomes particularly disturbed during geomagnetic storms caused by impacts of coronal mass ejections compounded by high-speed plasma streams from coronal holes. Geomagnetic storm of March 17, 2015 was the largest in the current solar cycle. The high-latitude ionosphere dynamics is studied using arrays of ground-based instruments including GPS receivers, HF radars, ionosondes, riometers and magnetometers. GPS phase scintillation index is computed for L1 signal sampled at the rate of 50 Hz by specialized GPS scintillation receivers of the Expanded Canadian High Arctic Ionospheric Network (ECHAIN). To further extend the geographic coverage, the phasescintillation proxy index is obtained from geodetic-quality GPS data sampled at 1 Hz. In the context of solar wind coupling to the magnetosphere-ionosphere system, it has been demonstrated that GPS phase scintillation is primarily enhanced in the cusp, tongue of ionization (TOI) broken into patches drawn into the polar cap from the dayside storm-enhanced plasma density (SED) and in the auroral oval during energetic particle precipitation events, substorms and pseudo-breakups in particular. In this paper we examine the relation to auroral electrojet currents observed by arrays of ground-based magnetometers and energetic particle precipitation observed by DMSP satellites. Equivalent ionospheric currents (EICs) are obtained from ground magnetometer data using the spherical elementary currents systems (SECS) technique developed by Amm and Viljanen (1999) that has been applied over the entire North American ground magnetometer network by Weygand et al.(2011).","author_count":11,"contributors":["Prikryl, Paul","Ghoddousi-Fard, Reza","Connors, Martin","Weygand, James M.","Danskin, Donald W.","Thayyil Jayachandran, P.","G. Thomas, Evan","Ruohoniem, Mike","Durgonics, Tibor","Oksavik, Kjellmar","Zhang, Yongliang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-317192"],"event":{"end":"2016-05-26","place":"Chiba-city, jp","start":"2016-05-22","title":"Japan Geoscience Union Meeting 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Canada","Norway","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Athabasca University","Johns Hopkins University","Natural Resources Canada","University of Bergen","University of California at Los Angeles","University of New Brunswick","Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gps phase scintillation during the geomagnetic storm of march 000000000017 000000002015 the relation to auroral electrojet currents","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-317192","ids":["dtu-2a5fabe9-c1e5-4471-a554-b19d5e6dff49"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DDF0FD575C70E6986BB78933204EE4BD"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ca","key":"university of new brunswick","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of New Brunswick","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ca","key":"natural resources canada","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Natural Resources Canada","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ca","key":"athabasca university","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Athabasca University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"university of california at los angeles","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of California at Los Angeles","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"virginia polytechnic institute and state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University","used":1},{"affno":"6","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute, Geodesy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"no","key":"university of bergen","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Bergen","used":1},{"affno":"8","country":"us","key":"johns hopkins university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Johns Hopkins University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Paul","key":"prikrylpau","last":"Prikryl","name":"Prikryl, Paul","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Reza","key":"ghoddousifardpau","last":"Ghoddousi-Fard","name":"Ghoddousi-Fard, Reza","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"connorspau","last":"Connors","name":"Connors, Martin","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"James M.","key":"weygandpau","last":"Weygand","name":"Weygand, James M.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Donald W.","key":"danskinpau","last":"Danskin","name":"Danskin, Donald W.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"P.","key":"thayyiljayachandranpau","last":"Thayyil Jayachandran","name":"Thayyil Jayachandran, P.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Evan","key":"gthomaspau","last":"G. Thomas","name":"G. Thomas, Evan","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Mike","key":"ruohoniempau","last":"Ruohoniem","name":"Ruohoniem, Mike","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tibor","key":"durgonicspau","last":"Durgonics","locid":"7eb048ae-5886-4422-8d5d-463acd0f162a","name":"Durgonics, Tibor","orcid":"0000-0002-9499-9585","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","corresponding":null,"first":"Kjellmar","key":"oksavikpau","last":"Oksavik","name":"Oksavik, Kjellmar","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"first":"Yongliang","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Yongliang","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-2a5fabe9-c1e5-4471-a554-b19d5e6dff49"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"GPS phase scintillation during the geomagnetic storm of March 17, 2015: The relation to auroral electrojet currents","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-317192","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Leptin is an adipocyte-secreted hormone, the circulating levels of which correlate closely with overall adiposity. Although rare mutations in the leptin (LEP) gene are well known to cause leptin deficiency and severe obesity, no common loci regulating circulating leptin levels have been uncovered. Therefore, we performed a genome-wide association study (GWAS) of circulating leptin levels from 32,161 individuals and followed up loci reaching P<10(-6) in 19,979 additional individuals. We identify five loci robustly associated (P<5 × 10(-8)) with leptin levels in/near LEP, SLC32A1, GCKR, CCNL1 and FTO. Although the association of the FTO obesity locus with leptin levels is abolished by adjustment for BMI, associations of the four other loci are independent of adiposity. The GCKR locus was found associated with multiple metabolic traits in previous GWAS and the CCNL1 locus with birth weight. Knockdown experiments in mouse adipose tissue explants show convincing evidence for adipogenin, a regulator of adipocyte differentiation, as the novel causal gene in the SLC32A1 locus influencing leptin levels. Our findings provide novel insights into the regulation of leptin production by adipose tissue and open new avenues for examining the influence of variation in leptin levels on adiposity and metabolic health.","author_count":188,"contributors":["Kilpeläinen, Tuomas O","Carli, Jayne F Martin","Skowronski, Alicja A","Sun, Qi","Kriebel, Jennifer","Feitosa, Mary F","Hedman, Åsa K","Drong, Alexander W","Hayes, James E","Zhao, Jinghua","Pers, Tune H","Schick, Ursula","Grarup, Niels","Kutalik, Zoltán","Trompet, Stella","Mangino, Massimo","Kristiansson, Kati","Beekman, Marian","Lyytikäinen, Leo-Pekka","Eriksson, Joel","Henneman, Peter","Lahti, Jari","Tanaka, Toshiko","Luan, Jian'an","Greco M, Fabiola Del","Pasko, Dorota","Renström, Frida","Willems, Sara M","Mahajan, Anubha","Rose, Lynda M","Guo, Xiuqing","Liu, Yongmei","Kleber, Marcus E","Pérusse, Louis","Gaunt, Tom","Ahluwalia, Tarunveer S","Ju Sung, Yun","Ramos, Yolande F","Amin, Najaf","Amuzu, Antoinette","Barroso, Inês","Bellis, Claire","Blangero, John","Buckley, Brendan M","Böhringer, Stefan","I Chen, Yii-Der","de Craen, Anton J N","Crosslin, David R","Dale, Caroline E","Dastani, Zari","Day, Felix R","Deelen, Joris","Delgado, Graciela E","Demirkan, Ayse","Finucane, Francis M","Ford, Ian","Garcia, Melissa E","Gieger, Christian","Gustafsson, Stefan","Hallmans, Göran","Hankinson, Susan E","Havulinna, Aki S","Herder, Christian","Hernandez, Dena","Hicks, Andrew A","Hunter, David J","Illig, Thomas","Ingelsson, Erik","Ioan-Facsinay, Andreea","Jansson, John-Olov","Jenny, Nancy S","Jørgensen, Marit E","Jørgensen, Torben","Karlsson, Magnus","Koenig, Wolfgang","Kraft, Peter","Kwekkeboom, Joanneke","Laatikainen, Tiina","Ladwig, Karl-Heinz","LeDuc, Charles A","Lowe, Gordon","Lu, Yingchang","Marques-Vidal, Pedro","Meisinger, Christa","Menni, Cristina","Morris, Andrew P","Myers, Richard H","Männistö, Satu","Nalls, Mike A","Paternoster, Lavinia","Peters, Annette","Pradhan, Aruna D","Rankinen, Tuomo","Rasmussen-Torvik, Laura J","Rathmann, Wolfgang","Rice, Treva K","Brent Richards, J","Ridker, Paul M","Sattar, Naveed","Savage, David B","Söderberg, Stefan","Timpson, Nicholas J","Vandenput, Liesbeth","van Heemst, Diana","Uh, Hae-Won","Vohl, Marie-Claude","Walker, Mark","Wichmann, Heinz-Erich","Widén, Elisabeth","Wood, Andrew R","Yao, Jie","Zeller, Tanja","Zhang, Yiying","Meulenbelt, Ingrid","Kloppenburg, Margreet","Astrup, Arne","Sørensen, Thorkild I A","Sarzynski, Mark A","Rao, D C","Jousilahti, Pekka","Vartiainen, Erkki","Hofman, Albert","Rivadeneira, Fernando","Uitterlinden, André G","Kajantie, Eero","Osmond, Clive","Palotie, Aarno","Eriksson, Johan G","Heliövaara, Markku","Knekt, Paul B","Koskinen, Seppo","Jula, Antti","Perola, Markus","Huupponen, Risto K","Viikari, Jorma S","Kähönen, Mika","Lehtimäki, Terho","Raitakari, Olli T","Mellström, Dan","Lorentzon, Mattias","Casas, Juan P","Bandinell